WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:02.000
What do you need me to do?

00:02.400 --> 00:08.800
Of the disaster relief supplies dispatched to Qing Province, only half were delivered. The remainder was embezzled by Chen Ying

00:23.720 --> 00:26.000
and concealed in this secret depot.

00:30.880 --> 00:36.600
Pocketing silver and grain is a minor offense to the Chen clan, but it will suffice to derail the imperial marriage!
